026</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Who can apply for the UP Board Compartment Examination 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> Students of UP Board Class 10th and 12th who have failed in one or more subjects or are eligible for the compartment examination can apply.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How can I apply for the UP Board Compartment Exam 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Candidates can apply online through the official UPMSP website by filling out the application form and paying the required examination fee.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is the purpose of the Compartment Examination?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> The compartment examination provides students with an opportunity to improve their results by reappearing in the subjects they did not pass.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What documents are required for the application process?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Candidates may need their roll number, mark sheet details, passport-size photograph, signature, and other required documents.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is UP Board (UPMSP) Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of UP Board (UPMSP) is https://upmsp.edu.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
